cat > .gitignore << 'EOF'
.DS_Store
Xcode user data
*.xcuserdatad
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
xcuserdata/
Derived data
DerivedData/
Build products
build/
Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/
.build/
CocoaPods (if you add later, consider committing Pods or not per your policy)
Pods/
Carthage
Carthage/Build/
Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots
fastlane/test_output
Playgrounds
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace
EOF
